---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME, TRANSLATION } from '../config.mjs';
import { ui } from '../i18n/en.mjs';
---

<Layout title={`About – ${ui.siteName}`}>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    {SITE_NAME} is a simple, free tool for drawing a random Bible verse — either a completely
    random pick, or one chosen from a topic such as hope, peace, love, strength, faith, comfort,
    wisdom, or gratitude.
  </p>
  <p>
    The whole tool runs in your browser. It does not require an account, and it does not send your
    chosen topic or the verse you received to any server. The verse library is a small, curated
    selection of well-known passages, so you get a meaningful verse every time rather than a random
    line of Scripture.
  </p>

  <h2>Translation and source</h2>
  <p>
    All Scripture on this site is taken from the {TRANSLATION.name} ({TRANSLATION.id}). The WEB is
    a modern English translation of the Bible that has been released into the public domain, so you
    may freely quote, copy, and share any verse you find here. The text is extracted from the
    official source at <a href={TRANSLATION.sourceUrl}>{TRANSLATION.sourceUrl}</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    “World English Bible” is a trademark of eBible.org. This site is an independent project and is
    not operated by, endorsed by, or affiliated with eBible.org.
  </p>

  <h2>Features</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Generate a random verse, or filter by one of eight topics.</li>
    <li>Copy a verse with one click.</li>
    <li>Read a verse in context, or open its full chapter.</li>
    <li>Works on phone, tablet, and desktop.</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
